{"id":"steam-2303850","steam":2303850,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Toxic Crusaders","summary":"The Toxic Crusaders return for an all-new, all-action beat 'em up for one to four players! Grab your mop, tutu and attitude, and get ready to clean up the mean streets of Tromaville and beyond, one radioactive menace at a time!","about":"Toxic Crusaders is an action-packed beat 'em up where players take control of one of seven playable characters. Stop the plans of the evil Czar Zosta and Dr. Killemoff by taking on hordes of Radiation Rangers, troublesome thugs, and zombie chickens across eleven disgustingly beautiful levels rendered in full-color pixel-art graphics!\n\n\r\n\nTHE GANG'S ALL HERE\n\nUp to four players can play together in local co-op! Choose from seven playable characters, including the beloved Toxie, acrobatic Nozone, speedy Junkyard, mighty Major Disaster, gnarly Headbanger, and, for the first time ever, the bubbly Yvonne and the indomitable Mrs. Junko!\n\n\r\n\nHIDDEN GEMS IN THE JUNKYARD\n\nKeep an eye out for references, easter eggs, and cameos from fan-favorite characters across the Tromaverse! Whether you're a die-hard Troma fan or a newcomer, you'll be given a fresh dose of off-beat humor and unexpected antics!\n\n\r\n\nWELCOME BACK TO TROMAVILLE\n\nServing as the spiritual successor to the original Toxic Crusaders cartoon from the '90s, the game's story comes alive with over 20 minutes of colorful, hand-drawn motion comics! Follow the Crusaders as they seek to end the pollution-plotting schemes of Czar Zosta and his top minion, Dr. Killemoff. With the fate of Earth -- and a clean environment! -- hanging in the balance, you'll be able to watch the game's story evolve between Episodes!\n\n\r\n\nFULLY APPROVED BY LLOYD KAUFMAN AND THE ANGRY VIDEO GAME NERD!!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2303850/fc98357bc2f091e219682d31353d0ef459ac309e/library_capsule.jpg?t=1781288408","coverFallback":"https://share